# Cachy-Void — SATA Active Link Power Management off (architecture.md §3.3).
# Provenance: CachyOS-Settings 50-sata.rules (verified 2026-08-15). Latency over
# power on SATA link transitions — the desktop-gaming default.
ACTION=="add", SUBSYSTEM=="scsi_host", KERNEL=="host*", \
    ATTR{link_power_management_supported}=="1", \
    ATTR{link_power_management_policy}=="*", \
    ATTR{link_power_management_policy}="max_performance"
